    "Name": "Mars",
    "Details": "A monster of a unit, these heavily armed vehicles are the epitome of the Tank.  Line breakers and fire support platforms, these are usually found in the front of an attack. Carrying an array of ranged weapons, the Assault Tank is designed to smash targets at range.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 2/3 hexes / 60/90 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Glazed (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Environmental Sealing\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       400     50\n<b>Left</b>         350     50\n<b>Right</b>       350     50\n<b>Rear</b>        270     50\n<b>Turret</b>      350     50\n\n<b>Total</b>      1720    250</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>",
    "Icon": "Mars"
  },
